1
00:00:00,449 --> 00:00:03,288
So let's now improve this modal by replacing

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:05,053
this action placeholder here

3
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:07,090
with more useful text.

4
00:00:07,716 --> 00:00:11,181
To be precise, I wanna either say add or

5
00:00:11,261 --> 00:00:12,015
remove here

6
00:00:12,545 --> 00:00:15,256
depending on where we clicked on one of

7
00:00:15,256 --> 00:00:16,443
these place objects.

8
00:00:17,341 --> 00:00:19,635
Now, as always, there definitely are

9
00:00:20,004 --> 00:00:21,368
different ways of achieving this.

10
00:00:21,993 --> 00:00:24,544
One pretty convenient way of achieving this

11
00:00:25,122 --> 00:00:27,657
is to go to the place, where we added all

12
00:00:27,705 --> 00:00:29,536
those HTMX attributes.

13
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:32,201
So where we have the button that's in the

14
00:00:32,201 --> 00:00:33,855
end clicked when we click one of these

15
00:00:33,951 --> 00:00:34,336
places.

16
00:00:35,813 --> 00:00:39,105
And then I'll add some extra attribute to

17
00:00:39,121 --> 00:00:42,894
that button, but now not an HTMX-specific

18
00:00:43,022 --> 00:00:43,488
attribute,

19
00:00:44,082 --> 00:00:46,618
but instead an attribute you could always

20
00:00:46,795 --> 00:00:49,364
add to HTML elements even if you're not

21
00:00:49,364 --> 00:00:50,391
using HTMX.

22
00:00:51,547 --> 00:00:52,591
And that's the data-data.

23
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:57,711
Which allows you to attach extra data to DOM

24
00:00:57,791 --> 00:00:58,209
elements.

25
00:00:59,653 --> 00:01:01,868
And here I wanna add data-action.

26
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:05,817
This identifier after the data-part is up

27
00:01:05,817 --> 00:01:07,807
to you though, can be anything you want.

28
00:01:09,123 --> 00:01:11,515
And you can store any value you want. And

29
00:01:11,595 --> 00:01:14,372
here for the POST request button attributes,

30
00:01:14,805 --> 00:01:16,876
I wanna add a text of Add.

31
00:01:18,176 --> 00:01:20,503
For the DELETE request, I wanna add a text

32
00:01:20,503 --> 00:01:20,888
of Remove.

33
00:01:22,913 --> 00:01:25,214
Therefore, this button which triggers either

34
00:01:25,230 --> 00:01:28,271
a POST or a DELETE request will always have

35
00:01:28,303 --> 00:01:30,604
this data-action attribute on it

36
00:01:31,183 --> 00:01:33,552
and that attribute then holds either the

37
00:01:33,552 --> 00:01:35,519
text add or the text remove.

38
00:01:37,202 --> 00:01:39,179
We can now use that in main.js

39
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,494
because as we just saw,

40
00:01:42,024 --> 00:01:44,403
we get access to the element that triggered

41
00:01:44,580 --> 00:01:46,883
the event on that detail property.

42
00:01:48,565 --> 00:01:51,237
We would also get access to it with help of

43
00:01:51,286 --> 00:01:53,942
the target here, but the detail is the safer

44
00:01:53,942 --> 00:01:56,036
way since that's guaranteed to be the

45
00:01:56,036 --> 00:01:58,729
element on which we added the HTMX

46
00:01:58,795 --> 00:01:59,370
attributes.

47
00:02:01,710 --> 00:02:05,072
So therefore, we can extract this action

48
00:02:05,121 --> 00:02:07,711
text here in show confirmation modal

49
00:02:08,258 --> 00:02:10,334
by accessing event.detail.elt,

50
00:02:12,831 --> 00:02:15,287
and then there it's the dataset property

51
00:02:16,136 --> 00:02:18,604
which is a standard property that exists on

52
00:02:18,716 --> 00:02:20,655
DOM objects in JavaScript,

53
00:02:21,696 --> 00:02:23,908
to access all these different data

54
00:02:23,924 --> 00:02:25,670
attributes we might have added to the

55
00:02:25,670 --> 00:02:26,023
element.

56
00:02:27,433 --> 00:02:30,381
And here I added data-action, and it's then

57
00:02:30,413 --> 00:02:33,730
the part after the data-part, so in my case

58
00:02:33,922 --> 00:02:34,307
action,

59
00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:37,976
that I can use as a property on that dataset

60
00:02:38,089 --> 00:02:41,149
object that exists on that DOM element. So

61
00:02:41,149 --> 00:02:43,683
here I can access action, since I chose

62
00:02:43,956 --> 00:02:46,766
data-action as a name here to get hold of

63
00:02:46,766 --> 00:02:49,495
the text I set on that specific element.

64
00:02:50,459 --> 00:02:53,156
So that will yield either add or remove and

65
00:02:53,269 --> 00:02:55,597
that's then stored in this action constant.

66
00:02:56,625 --> 00:02:59,017
And I can then therefore replace this action

67
00:02:59,049 --> 00:03:02,164
placeholder in my text down here with this

68
00:03:02,244 --> 00:03:04,926
action constant and therefore with the text

69
00:03:05,135 --> 00:03:07,688
add or remove depending on which button was

70
00:03:07,784 --> 00:03:08,057
clicked.

71
00:03:10,066 --> 00:03:11,899
So with that, if we save that,

72
00:03:12,623 --> 00:03:15,018
if I reload and I click an element here, you

73
00:03:15,018 --> 00:03:17,205
see, do you really want to add this place

74
00:03:17,205 --> 00:03:17,382
here?

75
00:03:17,993 --> 00:03:20,019
And if I had a place in the upper list and I

76
00:03:20,019 --> 00:03:22,028
would click that, I would instead see the

77
00:03:22,028 --> 00:03:24,488
text remove. We'll see that in action later.

78
00:03:25,710 --> 00:03:26,803
So that works.

79
00:03:27,334 --> 00:03:29,922
Now let's make sure that these buttons do

80
00:03:29,922 --> 00:03:30,357
something.
